<div class="seg"><span class="seg-icon">🚗</span><div class="seg-txt"><strong>Primm → Las Vegas</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; ~40 mi &nbsp;·&nbsp; ~40 min &nbsp;·&nbsp; I-15 N · Seven Magic Mountains art installation visible east of I-15</div></div>

