  <div class="town-body">
    <div class="cs"><div class="cs-l"><div class="cs-ico">⚡</div><div><div class="cs-title">Tesla Supercharger — Las Vegas South Strip</div><div class="cs-detail">I-15 Exit 41 · Multiple stall locations near Strip · Charge to 90% before St. George (~120 mi)</div></div></div><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Tesla+Supercharger+Las+Vegas+I-15+exit+41" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🍽️</span> Food</div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Esther's Kitchen</div><span class="badge b-top">🏆 BEST IN VEGAS</span></div><div class="item-desc">Chef James Trees' celebrated seasonal Italian in the Arts District — wood-fired sourdough pizzas, handmade pasta, James Beard–nominated cooking. Featured on Netflix's <em>Somebody Feed Phil</em>. The genuine local answer to "where do you actually eat in Vegas?" Weekday lunch 11am–3pm, weekend brunch 10am. <em>Book ahead or arrive right at opening.</em></div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Esther%27s+Kitchen+1131+S+Main+St+Las+Vegas" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 4.7 · 3,400+ reviews</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Eggslut — The Cosmopolitan</div><span class="badge b-std">QUICK + EXCELLENT</span></div><div class="item-desc">Famous egg sandwich counter inside the Cosmopolitan — the Fairfax and the "Slut" bowl are icons. Lines move fast. Perfect when you want something exceptional without a full sit-down meal.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Eggslut+Cosmopolitan+Las+Vegas" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.4</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Yardbird — The Venetian</div><span class="badge b-std">SOUTHERN COMFORT</span></div><div class="item-desc">Celebrity-chef Southern American done properly — excellent fried chicken, waffles, and comfort plates. Genuinely high quality. Filling and fun, perfect before a long afternoon drive north.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Yardbird+The+Venetian+Las+Vegas" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.3</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Winnie &amp; Ethel's Downtown Diner</div><span class="badge b-std">OFF-STRIP LOCAL</span></div><div class="item-desc">Local diner near Fremont Street — pot roast French dip, meatloaf sandwiches, real comfort food at real prices. Zero tourist-trap energy. Great value and consistently warm service. If Esther's is your dinner plan, this makes a great casual lunch.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Winnie+and+Ethel%27s+Downtown+Diner+Las+Vegas" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.4</span></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🐾</span> Dog Walk</div>
    <div class="item dog"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Desert Breeze Park — Off-Leash Dog Run</div><span class="badge b-top">BEST DOG PARK IN VEGAS</span></div><div class="item-desc">Fully fenced off-leash area, separate large and small dog sections, grass and shade. About 10 minutes from the South Strip Supercharger. A solid chance to burn energy before the canyon drive to St. George. <em>Bring water — desert heat in summer is real even in the city.</em></div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Desert+Breeze+Park+Dog+Run+Las+Vegas" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
    <div class="item dog"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Sunset Park — Dog Friendly Area</div></div><div class="item-desc">Large southeast-of-Strip park with a dedicated off-leash area, lake views, and well-maintained grass. More spacious and calmer than Desert Breeze. Great if you have 30+ minutes and want a proper walk rather than just a run.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Sunset+Park+Las+Vegas+Dog+Park" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🏨</span> Hotels</div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">TownePlace Suites Las Vegas North I-15</div><span class="badge b-top">🏆 BEST RATED</span></div><div class="item-desc">Brand-new Marriott extended-stay rated 9.8/10 from 424+ reviews. Full kitchenettes, free hot breakfast buffet, outdoor pool and hot tub. Practically on your I-15 route north — closest quality pet-friendly hotel to the Supercharger in Las Vegas.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=TownePlace+Suites+Las+Vegas+North+I-15+4360+Nexus+Way" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 9.8/10</span><span class="pet-pill">🐾 40 lb · $150 fee</span></div></div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Platinum Hotel &amp; Spa</div><span class="badge b-std">NON-GAMING BOUTIQUE</span></div><div class="item-desc">One block from the Strip — non-gaming, non-smoking, genuinely peaceful. Indoor/outdoor heated pools, spacious suites, excellent reviews for calm atmosphere. The antidote to casino hotel chaos. Pet-friendly, confirm fee.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Platinum+Hotel+and+Spa+Las+Vegas" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 8.7/10</span><span class="pet-pill">🐾 Confirm fee</span></div></div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Residence Inn Las Vegas Airport</div><span class="badge b-std">PRACTICAL CHOICE</span></div><div class="item-desc">Popular extended-stay Marriott near the airport — pool, BBQ grill, full kitchens, free parking, one of the most reviewed pet-friendly hotels in the city. Easy highway access for the morning push north.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Residence+Inn+Las+Vegas+Airport" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 8.5/10</span><span class="pet-pill">🐾 Pet-friendly</span></div></div>
  </div>
