    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Casablanca Casino Cafe</div><span class="badge b-std">CONVENIENT</span></div><div class="item-desc">Multiple food options under one roof on I-15 — cafe and grill, easy parking, quick in-out. Nothing exceptional but reliable and fast when you just need to eat and continue. Has outdoor seating adjacent to the resort grounds.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Casablanca+Casino+Mesquite+Nevada" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
