    <div class="item dog"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Virgin River Canyon Recreation Area</div><span class="badge b-std">SCENIC · 10 MIN SOUTH</span></div><div class="item-desc">Just south near Littlefield, AZ (I-15 exit 8) — dog-friendly trails along the Virgin River with shade shelters and dramatic canyon views. Leashed dogs welcome. BringFido rates this as one of the top dog-friendly stops between Vegas and Utah. Best if you have 30+ extra minutes.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Virgin+River+Canyon+Recreation+Area+Littlefield+AZ" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
