    <div class="cat"><span>☕</span> Coffee</div>
    <div class="item coffee"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Perks Coffee Espresso &amp; Smoothies</div><span class="badge b-top">🏆 VOTED BEST S. UTAH</span></div><div class="item-desc">Voted best coffee in Southern Utah — in-house roasted beans since 2003. The regional institution. Smooth espresso drinks, smoothies, and the warmth of a shop that's been doing this for two decades.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Perks+Coffee+Espresso+St+George+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 4.7</span></div></div>
    <div class="item coffee"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Cafe FeelLove</div><span class="badge b-std">PATIO + VIBE</span></div><div class="item-desc">Ranked #1 coffee shop in St. George by local press — iced chais, vegan bowls, outdoor patio that welcomes dogs at the tables. Near Utah Tech campus. Works as a light meal or an evening hang too.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Cafe+FeelLove+St+George+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 4.8</span></div></div>
    <div class="item coffee"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Bonrue Bakery</div><span class="badge b-std">PASTRIES + COFFEE</span></div><div class="item-desc">Rebranded from Farmstead in 2025 but same beloved owners — top-rated pastries, baked goods, and excellent coffee. Perfect for grabbing road snacks and a latte on departure day.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Bonrue+Bakery+St+George+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 4.8</span></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🍽️</span> Food</div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Wood Ash Rye (Advenire Hotel)</div><span class="badge b-top">🏆 BEST IN ST. GEORGE</span></div><div class="item-desc">The finest dining in town — seasonal menu, exceptional cocktails, strong wine program. Regularly on regional "best of" lists. Set inside the beautiful Advenire Hotel downtown. Where locals send out-of-town guests for a special meal.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Wood+Ash+Rye+Advenire+Hotel+St+George+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 4.7</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Angelica's Mexican Grill</div><span class="badge b-std">AUTHENTIC LOCAL</span></div><div class="item-desc">Family-owned, art-adorned, and consistently beloved by residents — authentic street tacos, burritos, and chile verde made fresh. Fast service, great value, one of those places you'd find in any "ask a local" food guide.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Angelica%27s+Mexican+Grill+St+George+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.5</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Ernie's The French Bakery</div><span class="badge b-std">PASTRY + LUNCH</span></div><div class="item-desc">Acclaimed as one of the finest bakeries in the country — European-quality pastries that reviewers say rival Paris and San Francisco. Perfect for a light lunch with world-class baked goods. A real destination.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Ernie%27s+The+French+Bakery+St+George+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 4.8</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Morty's Cafe</div><span class="badge b-std">CASUAL BREAKFAST / LUNCH</span></div><div class="item-desc">Top pick for casual breakfast or brunch in St. George — friendly staff, consistent quality, genuinely local feel. Great if you want a low-key meal without a wait or reservation. Sandwiches, burritos, eggs done right.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Morty%27s+Cafe+St+George+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.5</span></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🐾</span> Dog Walk</div>
    <div class="item dog"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Snow Canyon State Park</div><span class="badge b-top">BEST WALK OF THE TRIP SO FAR</span></div><div class="item-desc">15 min west — stunning red and white sandstone canyon with leashed dogs welcome on many trails. The Red Sand Dune trail and lava tube hike are both dog-friendly and easy. Spectacular scenery with very manageable terrain. <em>Go early in summer — heat builds fast in the canyon. This is genuinely one of the most beautiful dog walks on the entire route.</em></div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Snow+Canyon+State+Park+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
    <div class="item dog"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Middleton Park Dog Park</div><span class="badge b-std">IN-TOWN OFF-LEASH</span></div><div class="item-desc">Fenced off-leash park right in St. George — grass, separate big and small dog sections, water stations. If your dog just needs a quick run-around, this is the spot. Easy to find, in town.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Middleton+Park+Dog+Park+St+George+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🏨</span> Hotels</div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">La Quinta Inn &amp; Suites St. George</div><span class="badge b-top">🏆 TOP PICK</span></div><div class="item-desc">Rated 9.4/10 Exceptional with nearly 2,000 reviews. Outdoor pool, gym, free WiFi. Easy I-15 access, close to Supercharger. La Quinta has <em>no breed restrictions and no weight limit</em> — the best chain for dogs of all sizes.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=La+Quinta+Inn+Suites+St+George+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 9.4/10</span><span class="pet-pill">🐾 No weight limit · No fee</span></div></div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Best Western Coral Hills</div><span class="badge b-std">GREAT VALUE</span></div><div class="item-desc">9.2/10 with 1,000+ reviews. Both indoor and outdoor pools — a real desert luxury. Free hot breakfast, consistently praised for cleanliness. Downtown St. George, walkable to dinner options.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Best+Western+Coral+Hills+125+E+Saint+George+Blvd" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 9.2/10</span><span class="pet-pill">🐾 Pet-friendly</span></div></div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Hyatt Place St. George</div><span class="badge b-std">UPSCALE</span></div><div class="item-desc">Modern full-service Hyatt downtown. Excellent reviews for cleanliness and service. Walking distance to Wood Ash Rye and Cafe FeelLove. Pool area with red rock views.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Hyatt+Place+St+George+Convention+Center" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 8.8/10</span><span class="pet-pill">🐾 Pet-friendly · confirm fee</span></div></div>
  </div>
</div>

