    <div class="cs"><div class="cs-l"><div class="cs-ico">⚡</div><div><div class="cs-title">Tesla Supercharger — Beaver, UT</div><div class="cs-detail">I-15 corridor · Good buffer between St. George and Richfield · ~100 mi from each</div></div></div><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Tesla+Supercharger+Beaver+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🍽️</span> Food</div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">The Creamery</div><span class="badge b-top">DON'T MISS THIS ONE</span></div><div class="item-desc">A genuinely unique stop — a specialty dairy plant established in 1952 that also functions as a restaurant. Local cheese, real milkshakes, and meals made with product from the adjacent facility. <em>The best thing to eat in Beaver by a wide margin</em> and a real slice of rural Utah. The ice cream alone is worth the stop.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=The+Creamery+Beaver+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.4 · One-of-a-kind</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Craigo's Pizza</div><span class="badge b-std">ROAD TRIPPER GEM</span></div><div class="item-desc">Consistently praised by road-trippers as a must-stop — fresh pizza, excellent service, Legos and puzzles for kids on the shelves. The staff even mailed back a stuffed animal a child left behind. That kind of place. <em>"A must stop if you're passing through."</em></div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Craigo%27s+Pizza+Beaver+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 4.6</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Timberline Inn Restaurant</div><span class="badge b-std">FAMILY DINER · OFF I-15</span></div><div class="item-desc">Well-loved family-style restaurant right off exit 109 — good taco salad, solid burgers, reliable comfort food. Tripadvisor reviewers who've been stopping for years describe it as their consistent I-15 favorite. Hotel attached if needed.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Timberline+Inn+Restaurant+Beaver+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.2</span></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🐾</span> Dog Walk</div>
    <div class="item dog"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Beaver City Park</div></div><div class="item-desc">Quiet, grassy municipal park right in Beaver — mature trees, benches, good clean restrooms. 2 min from I-15. Exactly the right scale for a mid-drive stretch without committing to a hike. <em>Elevation is ~5,800 ft — noticeably cooler than St. George, a welcome change.</em></div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Beaver+City+Park+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🏨</span> Hotels</div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Best Western Paradise Inn — Beaver</div><span class="badge b-top">TOP PICK</span></div><div class="item-desc">Highly rated and consistently praised for cleanliness, staff, and comfortable beds. Outdoor pool, free breakfast, small-town quiet. One of the best-reviewed hotels in Beaver. Easy I-15 access.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Best+Western+Paradise+Inn+Beaver+Utah" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 8.8/10</span><span class="pet-pill">🐾 Pet-friendly · confirm fee</span></div></div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Comfort Inn &amp; Suites Beaver I-15</div><span class="badge b-std">RELIABLE</span></div><div class="item-desc">Clean, modern Comfort Inn right off I-15. Free hot breakfast, indoor pool, consistent quality. One of the most-booked hotels in Beaver — solid and straightforward.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Comfort+Inn+Suites+Beaver+Utah+I-15" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="pet-pill">🐾 Pet-friendly</span></div></div>
