</div>

<div class="seg"><span class="seg-icon">🚗</span><div class="seg-txt"><strong>Beaver → Richfield, UT</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; ~35 mi &nbsp;·&nbsp; ~35 min &nbsp;·&nbsp; I-15 N then briefly I-70 · Shortest segment — great if you need to eat, sleep, or charge in a smaller town</div></div>

<!-- ─── RICHFIELD ─── -->
<div class="town">
  <button class="town-btn" onclick="tog(this)">
    <div class="town-head">
      <div class="town-name">Richfield</div><div class="town-state">UT</div>
      <div class="ticons"><span class="ti">⚡</span><span class="ti">🍽️</span><span class="ti">🏨</span><span class="ti">🐾</span></div>
