    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Spoons Bistro &amp; Bakery</div><span class="badge b-top">🏆 LOCAL FAVORITE</span></div><div class="item-desc">Contemporary American bistro with locally sourced ingredients — Crab Benedict, French dip, Spoonini Panini, and a beautiful outdoor patio. Reviewers describe it as <em>"Michelin class in a quaint homey diner."</em> Proceeds benefit Hope West Hospice. Genuinely exceptional food for a mid-highway stop.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Spoons+Bistro+Bakery+Grand+Junction+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 4.7</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Dream Cafe</div><span class="badge b-std">BRUNCH / LUNCH</span></div><div class="item-desc">Adorable downtown cafe on Main Street — all-day breakfast, Eggs Benedict, Pineapple Upside Down Pancakes, deli sandwiches, Bloody Marys, and mimosas. One of the most popular brunch spots on Colorado's Western Slope.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Dream+Cafe+314+Main+St+Grand+Junction+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.5</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Kannah Creek Brewing Co.</div><span class="badge b-std">BREWPUB LUNCH</span></div><div class="item-desc">Established local brewery using snow-melt water from Kannah Creek — excellent craft beer and all-American pub food with local sourcing. Great burgers and a relaxed atmosphere. Multiple locations, consistently praised service.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Kannah+Creek+Brewing+Grand+Junction+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.5</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Enstrom Candies</div><span class="badge b-std">ROAD SNACK HALL OF FAME</span></div><div class="item-desc">World-renowned almond toffee and house-churned ice cream — <em>"best candy-making in Colorado."</em> Watch production in action, pick up toffee for the rest of the drive. The toffee packs well and is legitimately exceptional. A GJ institution you'd regret skipping.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Enstrom+Candies+Grand+Junction+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> 4.8 · World-famous</span></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🐾</span> Dog Walk</div>
    <div class="item dog"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Colorado River Riverfront Trail</div><span class="badge b-top">BEST WALK · 2 MI FROM CHARGER</span></div><div class="item-desc">Paved trail through James M. Robb Colorado River State Park — leashed dogs welcome, shade from cottonwood trees, river views, flat easy walking. <em>Dogs can wade in calmer bank areas.</em> About 2 miles from the Mesa Mall Supercharger. Combine with your lunch stop for a perfect 45-min charge break.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Colorado+River+Riverfront+Trail+Grand+Junction" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
    <div class="item dog"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Lincoln Park Dog Park</div><span class="badge b-std">OFF-LEASH OPTION</span></div><div class="item-desc">Fenced off-leash park inside Lincoln Park — separate sections for large and small dogs, grass, water. If your dog needs a full off-leash sprint rather than a leashed walk, this is the spot. Near downtown, clean and maintained.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lincoln+Park+Dog+Park+Grand+Junction+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🏨</span> Hotels (alternate overnight if not pushing to Glenwood)</div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">La Quinta Inn &amp; Suites Grand Junction</div><span class="badge b-top">🏆 BEST FOR PETS + CLOSEST TO CHARGER</span></div><div class="item-desc">8.8/10, close to Mesa Mall Supercharger, free breakfast, hot tub, fitness center. La Quinta: <em>no weight limit, no breed restrictions, no pet fee</em>. The most practical pet-friendly hotel in Grand Junction for road-trippers on I-70.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=La+Quinta+Inn+Suites+Grand+Junction+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 8.8/10</span><span class="pet-pill">🐾 No weight limit · No fee</span></div></div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Hotel Maverick</div><span class="badge b-std">BOUTIQUE</span></div><div class="item-desc">Beautifully designed boutique hotel run by Colorado Mesa University's hospitality program — genuinely excellent restaurant (Devil's Kitchen), upscale feel, great service. More personality than any chain hotel. Dogs welcome.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Hotel+Maverick+Grand+Junction+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 8.7/10</span><span class="pet-pill">🐾 Pet-friendly · confirm fee</span></div></div>
  </div>
</div>

