    <div class="cat"><span>🍽️</span> Food</div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Talon's Restaurant at Rifle Creek</div><span class="badge b-top">BEST IN RIFLE</span></div><div class="item-desc">Well-reviewed local restaurant in Rifle — solid steaks, fresh salads, and a genuine step up from highway food. Rifle is a small Western Colorado town with more character than it gets credit for. Good lunch stop if you're between Parachute and Glenwood and want a real sit-down meal.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=restaurants+Rifle+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.3</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Sonic Drive-In (at the Supercharger)</div><span class="badge b-std">ZERO EFFORT</span></div><div class="item-desc">The Supercharger is literally at Sonic — cherry limeades, tater tots, and classic drive-in food right where your car is charging. Zero effort, surprisingly enjoyable. If you just need something fast and fun between towns, this works perfectly.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Sonic+Drive-In+Rifle+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🐾</span> Dog Walk</div>
