<div class="seg"><span class="seg-icon">🚗</span><div class="seg-txt"><strong>Rifle → Glenwood Springs, CO</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; ~26 mi &nbsp;·&nbsp; ~25 min &nbsp;·&nbsp; I-70 E · Glenwood Canyon begins — 12 miles of sheer 1,000-ft walls alongside the Colorado River. One of the most dramatic interstate drives in America.</div></div>

<!-- ─── GLENWOOD SPRINGS ─── -->
<div class="town">
  <button class="town-btn" onclick="tog(this)">
    <div class="town-head">
      <div class="town-name">Glenwood Springs</div><div class="town-state">CO</div>
      <div class="ticons"><span class="ti">⚡</span><span class="ti">☕</span><span class="ti">🍽️</span><span class="ti">🏨</span><span class="ti">🐾</span></div>
