    <div class="cat"><span>🍽️</span> Food</div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Arapahoe Cafe &amp; Pub</div><span class="badge b-top">MOUNTAIN TOWN CLASSIC</span></div><div class="item-desc">Longtime Dillon/Silverthorne institution — classic mountain-town fare, excellent burgers, hearty soups, warm pub atmosphere at 9,000 ft. Beloved by ski-season and summer road-trippers alike. Outdoor deck with mountain views when weather permits. A proper reward for crossing the Continental Divide.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Arapahoe+Cafe+Pub+Dillon+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.4</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Pug Ryan's Steakhouse &amp; Brewery</div><span class="badge b-std">BREWERY + STEAK</span></div><div class="item-desc">Local Dillon brewery with excellent food — steaks, burgers, house-brewed Colorado beer. A lively mountain atmosphere steps from the Supercharger at the Outlets. One of the most satisfying meals you'll have at altitude.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Pug+Ryan%27s+Brewery+Dillon+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.3</span></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🐾</span> Dog Walk — high altitude magic</div>
    <div class="item dog"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Dillon Reservoir — Blue River Recreation Area</div><span class="badge b-top">MOST SPECTACULAR DOG WALK OF THE TRIP</span></div><div class="item-desc">Leashed dogs welcome along the paved path around Dillon Reservoir — jaw-dropping views of Rocky Mountain peaks reflected in a vast high-alpine lake. This is one of the finest dog walks in Colorado, full stop. Do as little as 20 minutes or walk the full 18-mile loop. The air at 9,000 ft is cool and crisp even in summer. <em>Just 2 minutes from the Supercharger. Don't skip this.</em></div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Dillon+Reservoir+Blue+River+Recreation+Area+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🏨</span> Hotels</div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">La Quinta Inn &amp; Suites Silverthorne</div><span class="badge b-top">BEST FOR PETS</span></div><div class="item-desc">Mountain-view La Quinta — no weight limits, no breed restrictions, no pet fee. Free breakfast, walkable to the Supercharger and Dillon Reservoir trail. Wake up surrounded by the Rockies. The best value pet-friendly hotel in Summit County.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=La+Quinta+Inn+Suites+Silverthorne+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="pet-pill">🐾 No weight limit · No fee</span></div></div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Hampton Inn &amp; Suites Dillon/Silverthorne</div><span class="badge b-std">MOUNTAIN VIEWS</span></div><div class="item-desc">Well-reviewed Hilton property with mountain views, indoor pool, and free breakfast. Reliable at altitude. Easy I-70 access for the final morning drive into Erie.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Hampton+Inn+Suites+Dillon+Silverthorne+Colorado" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="pet-pill">🐾 Pet-friendly · confirm fee</span></div></div>
